\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Claude Code Brief \'97 Divine Align Healing website\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Build a bespoke marketing website for 
\f0\b Divine Align Healing
\f1\b0 , a reiki practice run by Izzy in Bedford. The tone is calm, delicate and beautiful. The site's job is to build trust, showcase her (excellent) Google reviews, drive follows and enquiries through her Instagram and Facebook, give her corporate wellbeing packages a proper home, and carry a blog she can grow over time.\
This is a PJMJ Studios build. Match the studio stack and quality bar.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
