\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Overall feel: 
\f0\b very calming, very thin, very brushed, all round beautiful.
\f1\b0  Think unhurried, spacious, delicate. A site that feels the way one of her sessions feels.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

